From 1017b8d9a6a5b68ff473bc28478031729deddcf1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Scott Hanan (t2 executor)" <t3exec@t2.tailc9b568.ts.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:07:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] fix(server): compat dispatch retries are idempotent and
 match 0.0.45 scope (#303)

Review 1 items 4-7:
- interrupt and session.stop interrupt only the newest active run, with
  command ids keyed by run, so a retry never moves the original id onto a
  different run; detach ids are keyed by session
- onlyIfSettled requires settledOverride 'settled', as the 0.0.45 decider did
- client-caused rejections are 400, anything else 500 (retryable); the
  authenticated actor is logged
- bootstrap / sourceProposedPlan turn starts are refused with 400 instead
  of being silently dropped; absent runtime/interaction modes leave the
  thread's modes alone
WIP: LegacyDispatch tests to update.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
